===A Secret Power===
As you proceed northward, you find a boy staring at a large tree. Speak to him, and he explains that he is considering using a certain move to create a room for himself inside the tree. He gives you {{TM|43|Secret Power}} so that you can establish your own [[Secret Base]] in any of the suspicious-looking {{DL|Secret Base|Locations|trees, wall markings, and clumps of grass}} scattered throughout the region. A Trainer can decorate their Secret Base as they wish, and can display up to 16 {{DL|Decoration|Generation III decorations|decorations}}.

==Route 113==
[[File:Hoenn Route 113 RS.png|thumb|350px|Route 113]]

Located between {{rt|111|Hoenn}} to the east and [[Fallarbor Town]] to the west, {{rt|113|Hoenn}} is constantly covered in [[volcanic ash]] by the same wind patterns that keep [[Verdanturf Town]]'s air clear and fresh. This abundant resource is used by the {{DL|Hoenn Route 113|Glass Workshop}} to craft unique items.
