===Glass Workshop===
The {{DL|Hoenn Route 113|Glass Workshop}} is located in the northwest part of the route. Speak to the owner to receive a [[Soot Sack]] in order to begin collecting ash. The powder is then obtained by walking through ash-covered grass in the area. After gathering enough units, it can then be exchanged for glass items and furniture.

